    "detailed_description": "Kowloon High-School Chronicle is a hybrid RPG, adventure, and first-person simulation game originally released in 2004 in Japan. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTreasure Hunters -  Adventurers who search for buried treasure scattered around the world. <br />\r\nIn Shinjuku, Tokyo, a young man appears as a transfer student at Kamiyoshi Academy. While he seems like a normal student, he is actually a treasure hunter. His mission is to discover a mysterious ruin hidden deep beneath the school. Accompanied by his new friends from school, he sets out to discover the mysteries of a super ancient civilization. However, numerous traps, monsters called &quot;&quot;Kehito&quot;&quot; that lurk within the ruins, and the clutches of the &quot;&quot;student council&quot;&quot; stand in his way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild your relationship with friends, solve puzzles, dodge traps, defeat enemies, and discover the great mysteries and treasure sealed beneath the school!",
    "about_the_game": "Kowloon High-School Chronicle is a hybrid RPG, adventure, and first-person simulation game originally released in 2004 in Japan. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTreasure Hunters -  Adventurers who search for buried treasure scattered around the world. <br />\r\nIn Shinjuku, Tokyo, a young man appears as a transfer student at Kamiyoshi Academy. While he seems like a normal student, he is actually a treasure hunter. His mission is to discover a mysterious ruin hidden deep beneath the school. Accompanied by his new friends from school, he sets out to discover the mysteries of a super ancient civilization. However, numerous traps, monsters called &quot;&quot;Kehito&quot;&quot; that lurk within the ruins, and the clutches of the &quot;&quot;student council&quot;&quot; stand in his way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild your relationship with friends, solve puzzles, dodge traps, defeat enemies, and discover the great mysteries and treasure sealed beneath the school!",
    "short_description": "A school romance adventure masterpiece is remastered and now released on Steam!",
